  "summary": "The experiment tested replacing the RNA encoder with scvi_n200 in a high-performing multiprofile multimodal configuration (avgpool aggregation, weighted fusion). Validation accuracy improved to 0.6776 (from 0.639), and F1 increased to 0.6464, suggesting scvi_n200 may enhance performance. However, the exact contribution of the RNA encoder versus other factors remains uncertain without further analysis."
